WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:03.545
- [Woman] What's scary
about being an entrepreneur?

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:06.757
- You know the truth is I don't
even know how to fully answer

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:10.302
that because I don't, that's
like asking me what's the best

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:14.890
thing about being a human being
or what's the greatest part of

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.518
breathing oxygen, right?

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:20.385
Like, you know, I,

00:00:20.385 --> 00:00:23.065
I mean the best part 
for me is that I'm

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:26.151
doing what I think I naturally
was born to do. It was kind of

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:29.154
like what was the worst part of
my life between six and 18 years

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:33.909
old and that was I was forced to
do school in a world where that

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:36.245
was like ripping my eye
directly out of my head.

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:38.230
Right?
- [Woman] Right.

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:41.208
- To me, the best part is
it's my natural being it's who

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:44.892
I am and I love entrepreneurship

00:00:44.892 --> 00:00:47.422
and meritocracy and capitalism

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:49.633
and market behavior so much

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:52.960
I even like them more 
than my own well-being.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.598
I secretly think that if 
I deserve to go out of business

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:59.179
that that would excite me
because I think I deserve it.

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:00.018
Right?

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:04.897
I love the game so
much that I'm often...

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:07.276
For example, right now we're in
a very political climate and I'm

00:01:07.276 --> 00:01:10.445
yelling at all my old white dude
rich friends in their 60s and

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:13.156
70s who think they're capitalist
still because they want a

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:16.285
Republican president to protect
their money and I'm like,

00:01:16.285 --> 00:01:20.455
"You're god damn loser because
you think that just because you

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:22.457
"made the money you're
entitled to save it."

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:26.158
Nobody, nobody is keeping 
IBM or Google or

00:01:26.158 --> 00:01:29.548
AT&amp;amp;T or BMW alive.

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:33.343
That's the market and nobody
should keep an individual alive.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:34.428
This is capitalism.

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:38.710
This is business and you should
grind forever and if you take

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:40.892
the foot off the
peddle in your 50s,

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:43.937
60s, 70s and 80s you
should lose upside.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:47.482
You should lose and so I just
love the game of business and

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:50.444
entrepreneurship and 
to me that excites me and

00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:52.187
that's the best part.

